  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:lefikhakh">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/1"/>Therefore, we are obligated
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/2"/>to thank You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/3"/>to praise You, and to glorify You;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/4"/>to bless, to sanctify,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/5"/>and to offer praise and thanks to Your Name.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/6"/>We are fortunate! How good is our portion!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/7"/>How pleasant is our destiny!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/8"/>How beautiful is our heritage!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/9"/>We are fortunate
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/10"/>we who rise early and stay late
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/11"/>in synagogues and houses of study,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/12"/>and unify Your Name each day—always
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lefikhakh/13"/>and lovingly say twice:</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
